ReplayKit patch 8 for win-capture-audio 2.3.4 (Ayrton09, commit d11b381).

Use OBS output-device capture for the optional compatibility mode. Only the selected capture backend
owns the desktop source at a time. Device audio never goes through the per-app mixer.

